1
00:00:00,172 --> 00:00:05,788
Part 16 mein dispatch aur delivery: invoiced orders ko van trip mein jodna,

2
00:00:05,788 --> 00:00:12,603
delivery person assign karna, van nikalna, delivery phone par receiver ka naam aur payment,

3
00:00:12,603 --> 00:00:16,272
na pahunch paaye maal ka kya, aur trip ka hisaab.

4
00:00:17,248 --> 00:00:19,958
Warehouse mein Dispatch kholiye.

5
00:00:19,958 --> 00:00:28,004
Ready to dispatch mein woh saare invoices hain jo ban chuke hain par abhi godown se nikle nahi.

6
00:00:28,004 --> 00:00:32,916
Har invoice ka number, chemist, pata aur value dikhti hai.

7
00:00:35,502 --> 00:00:43,668
Ek route ke invoices chuniye: City Care Chemists, Hinoo Family Pharmacy aur Doranda Drug House.

8
00:00:43,668 --> 00:00:47,450
Teeno Ranchi ke andar ek hi raaste par hain.

9
00:00:48,142 --> 00:00:56,136
Gaadi number, driver ka naam, route, aur delivery person yaani app wala user chuniye:

10
00:00:56,136 --> 00:00:59,333
Manoj, hamara demo delivery staff.

11
00:00:59,333 --> 00:01:01,026
Plan trip dabaiye.

12
00:01:01,697 --> 00:01:05,322
Trip ban gaya, dispatch number ke saath.

13
00:01:05,322 --> 00:01:09,127
Jab van godown se nikle, Van left dabaiye.

14
00:01:09,127 --> 00:01:13,477
Ab in orders ka status Out for delivery ho gaya.

15
00:01:14,157 --> 00:01:15,819
Ab Manoj ka phone.

16
00:01:15,819 --> 00:01:20,251
Usne apne employee ID aur PIN se login kiya hai.

17
00:01:20,251 --> 00:01:26,623
My deliveries mein aaj ka trip hai: har drop ka chemist, pata, value,

18
00:01:26,623 --> 00:01:29,393
aur Call aur Navigate buttons.

19
00:01:35,447 --> 00:01:38,572
City Care Chemists par maal diya.

20
00:01:38,572 --> 00:01:40,845
Record delivery kholiye.

21
00:01:40,845 --> 00:01:42,645
Outcome: Delivered.

22
00:01:42,645 --> 00:01:49,748
Received by mein lene wale ka naam zaroori hai: yahi proof of delivery hai.

23
00:01:49,748 --> 00:01:53,347
Chemist ne UPI se poore paise de diye.

24
00:01:54,079 --> 00:01:58,601
Collected mein rakam aur UPI reference likhiye, aur Save.

25
00:01:58,601 --> 00:02:04,471
Yeh paisa turant receipt ban kar chemist ke khaate mein jama ho jaata hai,

26
00:02:04,471 --> 00:02:06,771
sabse purane bill ke against.

27
00:02:12,094 --> 00:02:19,227
Hinoo Family Pharmacy par maal diya, payment baad mein hogi, toh sirf receiver ka naam.

28
00:02:19,227 --> 00:02:24,721
Doranda Drug House band mila: Outcome Could not deliver aur reason.

29
00:02:24,721 --> 00:02:30,378
Aisa invoice wapas dispatch desk par aa jaata hai, agle trip ke liye.

30
00:02:31,051 --> 00:02:38,437
Office mein dispatch board par trip ka poora hisaab hai: har invoice ka status, kisne liya,

31
00:02:38,437 --> 00:02:40,223
aur kitna collect hua.

32
00:02:40,223 --> 00:02:46,311
Delivery reconciliation ke liye driver se cash aur UPI isi list se milaiye.

33
00:02:46,991 --> 00:02:52,267
Photo ya signature se proof of delivery abhi uplabdh nahi hai.

34
00:02:52,267 --> 00:02:55,841
Proof receiver ke naam se record hota hai.

35
00:02:55,841 --> 00:02:59,755
Yeh limitation hamari QA report mein darj hai.
